# Scope Studio control plane. Hosted on Railway; holds the secrets a user's
# machine must never see. Copy to .env for local development.
# The server refuses to start on a missing required value: never put a
# placeholder or a default here.

# Required. On Railway, reference the Postgres service's private URL:
#   ${{Postgres.DATABASE_URL}}
# Locally: createdb scope_control_dev
DATABASE_URL=

# Tests only, and only against localhost (the helpers refuse anything else).
# Locally: createdb scope_control_test
TEST_DATABASE_URL=

# Railway sets PORT itself. Locally the control plane defaults to 3101 so it
# can run beside the local engine on 3001.
# PORT=3101

# ---- Accounts and sign-in -------------------------------------------------

# ---- Billing (Stripe Managed Payments) -------------------------------------

# ---- Platform cloud ---------------------------------------------------------

# The platform's Anthropic key: it pays for Student and Engineer cloud answers
# (POST /v1/cloud/messages). Create it at console.anthropic.com -> Settings ->
# API keys, in the workspace whose spend limit backs the plans, and set it as a
# Railway variable on this service only; the local engine never holds it.
# Optional: without it the endpoint answers 503 platform_cloud_unavailable and
# never falls back to any other key.
PLATFORM_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Tests only: the tests point the Anthropic client at the local stand-in in
# test/fakeAnthropic.js through this. Leave unset everywhere else.
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=
